WEBVTT

00:00.920 --> 00:02.280
These years.

00:04.200 --> 00:05.600
In the end, I.

00:06.680 --> 00:08.280
Have wronged your Xie family.

00:09.840 --> 00:11.240
This edict.

00:12.840 --> 00:15.880
One copy for you the other.

00:17.640 --> 00:23.253
I have sealed in the Yuzheng Palace in the daily records of the 24th year of Yuankang.

00:50.920 --> 00:53.800
Your servant thanks Your Majesty for your mercy.

00:54.960 --> 00:58.200
Your servant kowtows in gratitude to Your Majesty.

01:03.640 --> 01:05.040
Go.

